  "prefLabel": "Ncr 733.09 Alcohol",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 733.09 Alcohol. The possession and consumption of alcoholic beverages shall be prohibited at all inland beaches and beach recreation areas, including but not limited to Bear Brook, Clough, Franconia Notch – Echo Lake, Ellacoya, Greenfield, Jericho Mountain, Kingston, Moose Brook, Pawtuckaway, Silver Lake, Sunapee beach, Wellington, Wentworth beach, and White Lake state parks.\n\nSource. #14055 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14291, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
